{"images":[{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Huawei/NetEngine%20AR720/NetEngine-AR720-P1-476x476.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei NetEngine AR720 2x GE WAN Combo Ports 8x GE LAN Ports High-Performance Enterprise Router","width":476,"height":476},{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Huawei/NetEngine%20AR720/NetEngine-AR720-P3-476x476.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei NetEngine AR720 2x GE WAN Combo Ports 8x GE LAN Ports High-Performance Enterprise Router","width":476,"height":476},{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Huawei/NetEngine%20AR720/NetEngine-AR720-P2-476x476.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei NetEngine AR720 2x GE WAN Combo Ports 8x GE LAN Ports High-Performance Enterprise Router","width":476,"height":476}],"thumbs":[{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Huawei/NetEngine%20AR720/NetEngine-AR720-P1-80x80.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei NetEngine AR720 2x GE WAN Combo Ports 8x GE LAN Ports High-Performance Enterprise Router","width":80,"height":80},{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Huawei/NetEngine%20AR720/NetEngine-AR720-P3-80x80.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei NetEngine AR720 2x GE WAN Combo Ports 8x GE LAN Ports High-Performance Enterprise Router","width":80,"height":80},{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Huawei/NetEngine%20AR720/NetEngine-AR720-P2-80x80.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei NetEngine AR720 2x GE WAN Combo Ports 8x GE LAN Ports High-Performance Enterprise Router","width":80,"height":80}],"labels":[{"out":false,"text":"-6 %"}],"banner":{"href":null,"image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Slider%20Image/OTECH-Home-delivery-1040x200.jpg.webp","alt":"Home Delivery","width":0,"height":0}},"title":"Huawei NetEngine AR720 2x GE WAN Combo Ports 8x GE LAN Ports High-Performance Enterprise Router","stats":[{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Special Price : 85,000৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Regular Price : 90,000৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Product ID : 404","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"product-stock in-stock","label":"Status:","value":"In Stock","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-manufacturer","label":"Brands:","value":"HUAWEI","href":"/huawei","plain":false},{"cls":"product-model","label":"Model:","value":"NetEngine AR720","href":null,"plain":false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"85,000৳","old":"90,000৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax: 85,000৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"404","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Processor: ARM64 4-core","c":[]},{"h":"Fixed WAN Ports: 2 x GE Combo Ports","c":[]},{"h":"Fixed LAN Ports: 8 x GE Ports (Can be switched to WAN ports)","c":[]},{"h":"Forwarding Performance: 9 Mpps to 25 Mpps","c":[]},{"h":"Outbound Bandwidth: 4 Gbit/s","c":[]},{"h":"Memory: 4 GB, Flash Memory: 1 GB","c":[]},{"h":"Input Voltage (AC): 100 V to 240 V 50 Hz/60 Hz 70W","c":[]},{"h":"Maximum Power Consumption: 33W","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 1 Year (Limited Warranty)","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"1098\">Huawei NetEngine AR700 series routers are next-generation high-performance routers. They use ARM-based multi-core processors and a non-blocking switching architecture, providing twice the industry average performance. Additionally, they integrate diverse functions such as 5G, routing, switching, VPN, security, and MPLS, enabling diversified enterprise services in the cloud era.</p><p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"1098\">The <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"785\">Huawei NetEngine AR720</strong> is a <strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"835\">high-performance enterprise-class router</strong> designed to deliver fast, reliable, and secure connectivity for <strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"937\">medium to large business networks</strong>. Featuring <strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"979\">2x Gigabit WAN Combo Ports</strong> and <strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1017\">8x Gigabit Ethernet LAN Ports</strong>, the AR720 supports flexible deployment in various enterprise network scenarios.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1365\">Built on Huawei’s advanced <strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1149\">NetEngine platform</strong>, the AR720 ensures <strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1233\">robust routing, security, and intelligent traffic management</strong>. It integrates <strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1256\">VPN</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1270\">firewall</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1279\">QoS</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1301\">IPv6 support</strong>, making it ideal for high-throughput, low-latency environments.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1569\">With <strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1411\">centralized management capabilities</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1439\">modular scalability</strong>, this router is perfect for organizations looking to optimize WAN performance, branch connectivity, and hybrid cloud integration.</p><p><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1599\"><strong data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1599\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"2190\"><li data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1637\">\n<p data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1637\"><strong data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1612\">Model:</strong> Huawei NetEngine AR720</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1685\">\n<p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1685\"><strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1654\">WAN Ports:</strong> 2 x Gigabit Combo (RJ45/SFP)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1725\">\n<p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1725\"><strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1702\">LAN Ports:</strong> 8 x Gigabit Ethernet</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1788\">\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1788\"><strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1752\">Routing Performance:</strong> Enterprise-grade, high throughput</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1850\">\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1850\"><strong data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1813\">Security Features:</strong> Built-in firewall, IPSec VPN, ACLs</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1912\">\n<p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1912\"><strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1868\">Management:</strong> Web UI, CLI, SNMP, Huawei eSight platform</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2061\">\n<p data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1940\"><strong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1938\">Advanced Functions:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2061\"><li data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1961\">\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1961\">Load balancing</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2011\">\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2011\">Static and dynamic routing (RIP, OSPF, BGP)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2032\">\n<p data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2032\">NAT, DHCP, QoS</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2061\">\n<p data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2061\">IPv4 &amp; IPv6 dual stack</p>\n</li></ul>\n</li><li data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2131\">\n<p data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2131\"><strong data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2075\">Design:</strong> Fanless or low-noise cooling with compact form factor</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2190\">\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2190\"><strong data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2150\">Reliability:</strong> Carrier-class stability and long uptime</p></li></ul><p><br></p><h3 data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2225\"><strong data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2223\">Ideal Use Cases:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2382\"><li data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2260\">\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2260\">Enterprise branch connectivity</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2295\">\n<p data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2295\">Campus or head office networks</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2335\">\n<p data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2335\">Secure VPN gateway for remote sites</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2382\">\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2382\">WAN optimization and hybrid cloud deployment</p></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco ASR-920-24SZ-M Router","href":"/cisco-asr-920-24sz-m-router","now":"73,000৳","old":"75,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Mikrotik CCR2116-12G-4S+ 16-Core ARM CPU 4x 10G SFP+ Cloud Core Ethernet Router","href":"/mikrotik-ccr2116-12g-4s-16-core-arm-cpu-4x-10g-sfp-cloud-core-ethernet-router","now":"112,000৳","old":"119,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Juniper MX80 Universal Router","href":"/juniper-mx80-universal-router","now":"175,000৳","old":"180,000৳","single":""},{"name":"MikroTik CCR2004-1G-12S+2XS Cloud Core Router","href":"/mikrotik-ccr2004-1g-12s2xs-cloud-core-router","now":"67,000৳","old":"68,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco C1111-8P Dual WAN Ethernet Integrated Services Router","href":"/cisco-c1111-8p-dual-wan-ethernet-integrated-services-router","now":"","old":"","single":"95,000৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/huawei-125g2125g-esfp-module-850nm-lc-duplex-multi-mode-05km","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Huawei/PLRXPL-VI-S24-HW-500x500-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei  1.25G/2.125G ESFP Module 850nm LC Duplex  (Multi Mode) 0.5km","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Huawei 1.25G/2.125G ESFP Module 850nm LC Duplex (Multi Mode) 0.5km","now":"","old":"","single":"900৳","tax":"Ex Tax:900৳","out":false},{"href":"/huawei-02310mnw-10gbase-usr-sfp-850nm-01km-multimode-transceiver-module","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/HUAWEI/HUAWEI-02310MNW-10GBASE-USR-SFP+-850nm-0.1km-Multimode-Transceiver-Module-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"HUAWEI 023